+RWFP_133=Every node can use this channel (%1 channels fit)
+RWFP_134=On a channel the nodes cannot use - the picker re-runs
+RWFP_135=Waiting for the nodes to report their channels
+RWFP_136=80 MHz, implied by puncturing
