+RWFP_138=Only DFS channels are left for the nodes; a fixed bandwidth or a manual channel lifts the Auto-width exclusions
+RWFP_139=Held while a node joins
 RSVY_1=Scan now
 RSVY_2=Export CSV
 RSVY_3=Every selected radio listens on every channel its regulatory domain allows, not only the channel it runs on, and reports each network it hears. A radio leaves its channel for a few seconds per scan, so its clients may stutter briefly.
